    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tzer](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tzer) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 45.951 depth occurred on Oct 03 2026 40km W of Tambolaka. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -9.5672 longitude 118.9078. It impacted 225099 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
